SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — 60-min easy ride\, 25–30km at 110–140
 W with HR ceiling of 140
DESCRIPTION:60-min easy ride\, 25–30km at 110–140W with HR ceiling of 1
 40 bpm\; if HR gate is breached at any point\, stop and return home — do
  not attempt 35–40km in the first weekend back from a week-long illness 
 shutdown.\n\nReason: Body battery has been critically low (0–11) for ove
 r a week and the athlete will have had only 4 days back in training\; a sh
 orter\, lower-power ride protects immune recovery while still providing a 
 positive aerobic stimulus.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-06
END:VEVENT
